          </div>
          <div class="aw-tradeoff-box" id="awTradeoff">
            <strong>Silicon Trade-off:</strong> Dedicated 32-entry CAM structures consume significant dynamic power on every memory access but guarantee that 99%+ of memory operations proceed without stall cycles.
